Usage: lute format [options] [files...]

Format Luau source files. Experimental: formatting is still under development, and its output will change.

Options:
  --help (-h) - Show this help message
  --verbose (-v) - Enable verbose output
  --check (-c) - Check formatting; exit 1 if any file is unformatted
  --no-ignore - Format every input, even ones matching lute.format.ignores
  --width - Layout column width (default: 120)
  --indent-width - Columns per indent level (default: 4)
  --use-spaces - Indent with spaces instead of tabs
  [files...] - Files or directories to format (defaults to current directory)
